---
title: Sketchbook — Dixita Ganatra
layout: main
pagination:
  data: collections.listings.sketchbook
  size: 1
  alias: listing
permalink: '{{ listing.url }}'
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: 'Sketchbook — {{ listing.label }} — Dixita Ganatra'
---
<article class='page sketchbook-page'>
  <header class='page-header'>
    <div class='sketch-heading'>
      <h1>Sketchbook.</h1>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class='sketch-license' id='artwork-license' aria-labelledby='artwork-license-title'>
    <h2 id='artwork-license-title'>Artwork use & credit</h2>
    <p>
      You’re welcome to use, share, or remix my artwork, with or without AI. If you use an image
      directly, as a reference, for style inspiration, or to create something new, credit Dixita
      Ganatra and link to <a href='{{ site.url }}/sketchbook/'>this Sketchbook page</a> alongside
      what you share.
    </p>
    <p>
      I can only give permission for my own contribution. For fan art and studies of other people’s
      work, rights in the original characters and artwork still belong to their owners.
    </p>
    <p class='sketch-credit-note'>
      Note: I’ve done my best to recall and credit the artists whose work inspired these pieces. If
      I’ve missed your work or you’d prefer a different credit, please contact me at
      <a href='mailto:contact@dixita.dev'>contact@dixita.dev</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
  {% include 'filter-nav',
    options: collections.listings.sketchbook,
    navClass: 'blog-filters sketch-filters',
    navLabel: 'Filter artwork by tag'
  %}
  <div class='sketch-grid' role='list' aria-label='Artworks'>
    {% for artwork in listing.items %}
      {% include 'sketch-tile' %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <noscript>
    <p>Select an artwork to open the full image. Enable JavaScript for the gallery viewer.</p>
  </noscript>
  <dialog class='sketch-preview' aria-label='Artwork preview'>
    <div class='sketch-preview__frame'>
      <button class='sketch-preview__close' type='button' aria-label='Close preview'>×</button>
      <button class='sketch-preview__previous' type='button' aria-label='Previous artwork'>
        ←
      </button>
      <figure>
        <div class='sketch-preview__image'><img alt=''></div>
        <figcaption aria-live='polite'>
          <span class='sketch-preview__title'></span>
          <span class='sketch-preview__credits'></span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <button class='sketch-preview__next' type='button' aria-label='Next artwork'>→</button>
      <p class='sketch-preview__error' hidden>
        Image unavailable.
        <a href='' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Open the original</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </dialog>
  <script type='application/json' id='sketchbook-artworks'>
    {{ listing.items | artworkPreviews | jsonForScript }}
  </script>
  <script src='/sketchbook.js' defer></script>
</article>
